      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To clarify more I tried as many workarounds and troubleshooting methods as I could. \n\n-I verified the files for vrchat and steam vr and tried the versions of each app\n\n-I tried uninstalling steamvr and vrchat several times and deleted the folders of both applications\n\n-i tried even rebooting my router just to make sure it wasn't my connection\n\nNothing has worked and the ONLY FIX was downgrading to the previous branch of steamvr. This issue started several months ago when this current update got launched on the beta branch of steamvr and now it's on the main branch so it's much more of an issue and I don't seem to be only only one having this issue",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
