  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-09-10T23:02:02.616Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I tried launch on desktop and i even tried restarting steamvr after rebooting vrchat on desktop then launching steamvr and trying it still gets stuck on connecting. This has been an issue since the steamvr introduced this update in beta months ago. I really hope this can be fixed soon",
